/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# The freeze cache is deliberately NOT committed. Quarto's convention is to
# commit it so a site can be rebuilt without the computational environment,
# but execution here only reads committed CSVs -- cheap and credential-free.
# Committing the cache would let a stale figure outlive a change to the data
# it is supposed to be drawn from.
/_freeze/

# Rendered output goes to ../_site/papers (see _quarto.yml), which the portal
# tracks and deploys. Nothing should land here.
/_site/
